        "content": "As the transit operations manager, I need to handle a critical safety incident on the Blue Line caused by an operator's misconduct. Investigate the station infrastructure impact, terminate the responsible operator, suspend the affected line, notify passengers about service changes, and clean up related incident records afterward.",
